                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Details: Funded-reserve filing by state and provider. Scope defaults to ITD (each state's latest filing); pick PERIOD to see the filing window. Lines come from the filed line values, sections 2 and 3.",
